The initial v0.1 implementation ports the behavior of the upstream
"委托助手" (Commission Assistant) story/dialogue skip flow, screen definitions
and the small template images referenced by that flow. See docs/upstream.md
for the file-by-file mapping and modification notes.

The Wuthering Waves ("鸣潮") story skip flow references the behavior of:

  ok-wuthering-waves
  https://github.com/ok-oldking/ok-wuthering-waves
  Copyright (C) ok-oldking contributors
  Licensed under AGPL-3.0

No source code or image assets from that project are copied: the upstream is
AGPL-3.0, which is not compatible with this project's GPL-3.0, so only the
skip flow and timing were used as a reference and reimplemented in Go. The
Wuthering Waves templates under assets/games/wuwa were cropped from in-game
screenshots; game artwork belongs to its respective rights holders.

